    "## Real invariant pilot\n",
    "\n",
    "Check formats, source-citation validity, exact tokens, measured input/output distributions and API compatibility on these separate 12 questions before training. No fabricated rewards or alternate-model fallback is allowed. Explicit provider filter/refusal markers are counted as abstentions under the user-approved policy, retaining raw bodies and actual reported usage. Unknown usage remains unknown. Malformed, truncated, context and other API errors still halt. All arms use the fixed 8,192-token completion cap, increased because an earlier 2,048-token request exhausted its budget before returning an answer. The archived earlier attempts remain cost/provenance evidence; their different requests are not primary results under the new cap. Do not choose methods by whether pilot answers are favorable. Authentication can be checked with `python machine_connection.py` without inference."
   ]
